WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.614
How does it feel?

00:00:01.614 --> 00:00:03.753
Still going strong.

00:00:05.918 --> 00:00:07.829
What's up guys, we are Pongfinity!

00:00:07.829 --> 00:00:10.186
Today we are making a racket out of ice.

00:00:10.186 --> 00:00:11.036
Let's build it!

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.058
So we are using aluminium foil to make the mould.

00:00:15.058 --> 00:00:16.558
Something like that...

00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:22.821
Okay now it's starting to look good.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.110
Okay now we just pop it out.

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:28.220
Yeah that should work.

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:31.375
Okay so let's pour the water on the mould.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:36.647
Yeah that's good.

00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:37.875
Yeah that's it.

00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:40.300
So now we just wait for it to freeze.

00:00:46.816 --> 00:00:47.316
Yeah!

00:00:48.784 --> 00:00:49.783
That's frozen solid.

00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:56.218
That looks just like a normal racket!

00:00:57.713 --> 00:00:59.386
I'm afraid I'm going to break it

00:00:59.386 --> 00:01:00.246
It feels so fragile.

00:01:00.741 --> 00:01:02.186
I guess we just...

00:01:02.186 --> 00:01:03.205
Head in and play with it!

00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:07.943
Okay so here we have the racket

00:01:08.448 --> 00:01:11.102
And now it's time to do some Instagram challenges.

00:01:11.423 --> 00:01:13.528
The racket is melting as we speak

00:01:13.528 --> 00:01:15.944
so we have to be really quick when filming this.

00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:18.752
So let's start with the easiest challenge!

00:01:18.752 --> 00:01:19.484
Around the net!

00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:24.513
Oooh that was close!

00:01:29.065 --> 00:01:30.183
First one in the can!

00:01:30.679 --> 00:01:32.154
How's the racket looking?

00:01:32.154 --> 00:01:33.351
Ooh it's dripping!

00:01:33.774 --> 00:01:35.556
Nooooo it's starting to melt!

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:38.054
Next challenge next challenge!

00:01:38.054 --> 00:01:39.866
Go go go go!

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.647
What's the next challenge?

00:01:40.647 --> 00:01:41.815
Xu Xin ball catch!

00:01:44.568 --> 00:01:45.617
Yeah we have to do higher.

00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:46.775
Lets go outside!

00:01:47.323 --> 00:01:49.462
I think out here we should have enough space.

00:01:50.318 --> 00:01:51.912
The roof isn't a problem anymore.

00:01:52.891 --> 00:01:54.078
No, not at all.

00:01:59.582 --> 00:02:00.436
No!

00:02:00.436 --> 00:02:01.343
This is really difficult.

00:02:06.613 --> 00:02:07.341
That was okay!

00:02:12.973 --> 00:02:13.920
That was quite good!

00:02:14.102 --> 00:02:16.748
The Xu Xin ball catch with an ice racket

00:02:16.874 --> 00:02:18.584
It's not melting outside anymore.

00:02:19.289 --> 00:02:20.603
He doesn't want to go back inside.

00:02:20.929 --> 00:02:22.400
But we have to take him back inside.

00:02:23.452 --> 00:02:24.908
Alright! Next one chopping!

00:02:25.508 --> 00:02:27.511
Is the racket gonna fly off my hand, or?

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:29.657
Wow! It's super fast!

00:02:31.772 --> 00:02:33.864
It's dropping so much water.

00:02:44.759 --> 00:02:46.574
Look at those chops.

00:02:48.554 --> 00:02:49.533
Come on! 

00:02:49.533 --> 00:02:50.660
It's possible.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.912
Totally working!

00:02:51.912 --> 00:02:55.196
It's just the whole floor is full of water drops

00:02:55.322 --> 00:02:57.616
Fast to the next challenge!

00:02:59.205 --> 00:03:01.871
Next one: try to get spin with the racket

00:03:03.313 --> 00:03:04.581
I don't think this is going to work.

00:03:05.341 --> 00:03:06.101
Ghost serve

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.170
The racket is shrinking between every shot

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.662
Okay forehand

00:03:20.386 --> 00:03:22.752
That was just floating over the table!

00:03:27.744 --> 00:03:29.307
Forehand topsin!

00:03:30.886 --> 00:03:32.616
It's almost like underspin

00:03:33.121 --> 00:03:35.091
And the status of the racket

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.299
Dropping, dropping, dropping.

00:03:37.499 --> 00:03:38.062
It's dropping.

00:03:38.557 --> 00:03:40.670
Behind the back and between the legs.

00:03:51.394 --> 00:03:53.617
Well... you got in the way Miikka!

00:03:54.543 --> 00:03:56.236
Okay so for the next challenge

00:03:56.804 --> 00:03:58.314
We are gonna ditch the glove

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.530
It's time to melt the racket!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.519
It's quite cold to be honest

00:04:04.561 --> 00:04:06.327
It's hard to grip it

00:04:06.674 --> 00:04:08.867
It got smaller just like in a second!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:13.600
I have a feeling I'm gonna loose my grip at some point

00:04:14.903 --> 00:04:17.627
It's like all the time flying drops there

00:04:17.627 --> 00:04:20.448
I'm trying to melt it as fast as I can!

00:04:26.193 --> 00:04:28.320
Quite good to play with this

00:04:28.612 --> 00:04:30.000
How does it feel?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.415
Yeah, still going strong

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.354
Come on, melt!

00:04:37.942 --> 00:04:39.229
It's a lot smaller now

00:04:39.229 --> 00:04:39.729
Yeah

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:46.174
You shouldn't have shown it!

00:04:46.174 --> 00:04:50.456
"I have a feeling I'm gonna loose my grip at some point"

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:59.339
Well, we could still do some racket sharing with this part!

00:05:01.403 --> 00:05:02.646
This is not going to work!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.663
Yes?

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:23.619
It's taking a lot of damage

00:05:24.904 --> 00:05:26.532
I think we are pretty much done

00:05:31.276 --> 00:05:33.060
Still going strong!

00:05:33.544 --> 00:05:35.469
His time has come!

00:05:35.616 --> 00:05:37.008
That's all what is left

00:05:37.292 --> 00:05:38.829
That used to be a table tennis racket

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:40.988
This is what he left behind

00:05:41.714 --> 00:05:44.644
Everything that is left from the ice racket

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:47.618
It's almost like a small heart

00:05:52.542 --> 00:05:55.040
Well, now it's a broken heart

00:05:57.702 --> 00:05:58.853
Okay guys

00:05:59.158 --> 00:05:59.983
Fun challenge

00:06:00.351 --> 00:06:01.961
Thanks for all the challenge ideas

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:03.921
Until next time!

00:06:04.058 --> 00:06:05.558
Otto you can have half of it

00:06:05.863 --> 00:06:06.437
Thank you!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.790
Who can eat it?

00:06:11.262 --> 00:06:12.617
Emil you have to eat it too!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.638
Otto is actually enjoying it

